OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and sunny day for most
OL,6,Fwith light winds. Cloudier in
OL,7,Fnorthwest Scotland and western parts
OL,8,Fof Northern Ireland with some
OL,9,Foutbreaks of light rain. Very warm in
OL,10,Fthe sunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FOutbreaks of rain will
OL,13,Fcontinue in the far northwest, but a
OL,14,Fdrier night elsewhere with clear
OL,15,Fskies. Staying mild perhaps with a few
OL,16,Fmist patches.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
