OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy in western Scotland
OL,6,Fand western parts of Northern Ireland
OL,7,Fwith showers, turning heavy at times.
OL,8,FA dry and sunny day elsewhere with hot
OL,9,Fsunshine.
